<title>UNITED NATIONS: U.N. SAYS OVERSEERS APPROVE TWO IRAQ OIL CONTRACTS.</title>
<headline>U.N. SAYS OVERSEERS APPROVE TWO IRAQ OIL CONTRACTS.</headline>
<dateline>UNITED NATIONS 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.N. overseers approved two Iraqi oil contracts on Monday for a total of 11.62 million barrels U.N. spokesman Hiro Ueki said.</p>
<p>&quot;The contracts were for 5.5 million barrels and a second one for 6.12 million barrels,&quot; Ueki said, refusing to name the companies receiving the contracts.</p>
